            "detailed_description": "<h1>The Greatest pack</h1><p></p><br><h1>Classic pack</h1><p></p><br><h1>Speed pack</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><i> Nonograms, also known as Picross or Griddlers, are picture logic puzzles in which cells in a grid must be colored or left blank according to numbers at the side of the grid to reveal a hidden picture. </i> © Wiki<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master's Legacy</strong></h2><br>Excellent attempt in a world of Nonogram/Picross puzzles. Galore of levels, multiple game modes along with level editor &amp; workshop would never disappoint any puzzle fan.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Totally free - Starter Pack, Community Levels &amp; Level Editor are available for everybody.<br></li><li> Gorgeous Starter Pack - perfect 15 Nonogram levels to get you started and tease your brain for more adventure.<br></li><li> Multiple DLC's with different game modes and level styles.<br></li><li> Completed all levels? Don't worry! We have an endless list of user-made paintings, you'll never feel lonely.<br></li><li> You should love to paint, do you? Go on and try our awesome level editor (up to 100x100 size), show those impostors who is the Greatest One here!<br></li><li> Art design - clean and beautiful.<br></li><li> Relaxing ambient soundtracks will keep your mind sharp and focused.</li></ul><br><i>Disclaimer - Master's Legacy is free version of The Greatest Painter. Master's Legacy's DLCs contains all puzzles from Nonogram - The Greatest Painter.</i>",
            "about_the_game": "<i> Nonograms, also known as Picross or Griddlers, are picture logic puzzles in which cells in a grid must be colored or left blank according to numbers at the side of the grid to reveal a hidden picture. </i> © Wiki<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master's Legacy</strong></h2><br>Excellent attempt in a world of Nonogram/Picross puzzles. Galore of levels, multiple game modes along with level editor &amp; workshop would never disappoint any puzzle fan.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Totally free - Starter Pack, Community Levels &amp; Level Editor are available for everybody.<br></li><li> Gorgeous Starter Pack - perfect 15 Nonogram levels to get you started and tease your brain for more adventure.<br></li><li> Multiple DLC's with different game modes and level styles.<br></li><li> Completed all levels? Don't worry! We have an endless list of user-made paintings, you'll never feel lonely.<br></li><li> You should love to paint, do you? Go on and try our awesome level editor (up to 100x100 size), show those impostors who is the Greatest One here!<br></li><li> Art design - clean and beautiful.<br></li><li> Relaxing ambient soundtracks will keep your mind sharp and focused.</li></ul><br><i>Disclaimer - Master's Legacy is free version of The Greatest Painter. Master's Legacy's DLCs contains all puzzles from Nonogram - The Greatest Painter.</i>",
            "short_description": "Master's Legacy - discover all beauty of Nonogram puzzles (multiple game modes, level sizes), master painting skills in Editor and share works with friends in Workshop. Become The Greatest.",
