                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Free Nonogram!\r\n\r\nJust like games they advertise on mobile phones.\r\n\r\nLots of options, undo, color with x's or fills.\r\n\r\nWhat's amazing, the game has level editor that actually functions! :o\r\nAnd community making custom levels is pretty active, I'd say. There's plenty of puzzles to choose, some are insanely good.\r\n\r\nAlso, the dev offers extra levels as DLC, but they're not necessary for 100%.\r\n\r\nTime to 100%: ~2 hours.",
